{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218460","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218460","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521846001:1":{"text":"Master Bakis...","source_cn":"……比博老师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x428A4F73E2D2F56B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521846002:1":{"text":"I've brought Perseus' favorite scroll as a child. When he was young, he loved reading about tactics, and this one he read over and over.","source_cn":"殿下，我带来了一份卷轴。珀尔修斯年轻时，最喜欢阅读其上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C3325AD219B2A67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"Bakis' Scroll","source_cn":"比博给的卷轴","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224C8AE13DFF3F17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521846003:1":{"text":"I think he'd want to have it with him.","source_cn":"就请让它陪伴珀尔修斯长眠吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x680BEDF8C44049E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521846004:1":{"text":"... Mhm.","source_cn":"……嗯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC970D8D7A9ECFD3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521846005:0":{"text":"Master Bakis... I'll do my best as Regulus. No more wars, no more grief. I won't... I won't let you bury another student.","source_cn":"老师……我会努力承担起领主的职责，不再让战争重演，也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB36EA45A9F9D4A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521846006:0":{"text":"Making peace with the Wildborn is just the beginning... I won't let Halia suffer again!","source_cn":"和雅库伯尔的和解只是第一步……我不会再让呼临城遭受灾难！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC52ED99DA3D8502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521846007:1":{"text":"I believe in you. You will make Halia a better place.","source_cn":"……好。我相信你，你一定可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F0724C54C4BE2D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1521846008:1":{"text":"With solemn reverence, the soldiers carry Perseus to his final resting place, the weight of his coffin sinking into the earth like a fading echo of his legend.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928D925E929884D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1521846009:1":{"text":"A never-ending stream of visitors flows past Perseus' resting place, each adding another offering to the growing mountain of mementos.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A60854CED5E74BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1521846010:1":{"text":"Perseus may be gone from sight, gone from sound, but his presence lingers... woven into the very stones of Halia, forever its guardian.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97493C6F0F1831A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:领主阿邦德":{"text":"Abundius","source":"领主阿邦德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:学者比博":{"text":"Scholar Bakis","source":"学者比博","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"Black Screen","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":3}}